  "description": "A modern, cross-platform serial port library for .NET — a semantic port of serialport-rs. True async I/O (poll reactor on Unix, IOCP on Windows), zero steady-state allocations, deterministic disposal, rich USB port enumeration, opt-in ReadLine/DataReceived layer. Targets net10.0 and netstandard2.0.",
